# mix-of-capabilities 08×09 × 14 — il contenimento geografico per la strada che la
# KB conosce (located_in, capital_of_country, continent_of), detta; mai un «No»
# che la KB non puo' reggere: si dice dove la strada porta.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test a capital reaches its continent through its country]
!timeout 30
> is tokyo in asia?
< Yes: Tokyo is in Japan, and Japan is in Asia.
> is paris in europe?
< Yes: Paris is in France, and France is in Europe.

[test a wrong place receives where the route leads, not a bare no]
!timeout 30
> is madrid in asia?
< Not as far as I know: Madrid is in Spain, and Spain is in Europe.
> is paris in spain?
< Not as far as I know: Paris is in France.
